<div class="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__left">
      <div class="eyebrow-chip"><span>Live LSP + MCP · find-similar prevents the copy-paste</span></div>
      <h1>
        Your agent is about to copy-paste.
        <em>Deslop tells it not to.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        Deslop is a <strong>live analysis server</strong> — LSP + MCP, running in your workspace — that feeds real-time duplicate-code signals to Claude, Cursor, Copilot, and your editor <em>as code is written</em>. Tree-sitter parsing, AST fingerprints, semantic fusion, millisecond response. Batch CLI reports are one output; the live stream is the product.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a href="https://github.com/Nimblesite/Deslop/releases/latest" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Install the VS Code extension</a>
        <div class="install-chip">
          <code>code --install-extension deslop-vscode-*.vsix</code>
          <button aria-label="Copy install command">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">content_copy</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__sublede">
        VS Code extension is the preferred install — you get the live bubble, the MCP server, the LSP server, and the CLI in a single bundle. Other IDE extensions coming soon. Just want the CLI? <code>brew install nimblesite/tap/deslop</code> or <code>scoop install deslop</code> (after adding the <a href="https://github.com/Nimblesite/scoop-bucket" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nimblesite bucket</a>).
      </p>
    </div>

